"""Generates port/mutations-config.json: one deliberate defect per behavior of the config system (src/config). Each `find` must occur
exactly once in its file (checked here), so a mutation never silently applies to the wrong place. Run with
`pigeq mutate --unit-only --go extensions/pi-permission-system --sdk-dir <PiG sdk> --mutations port/mutations-config.json`."""
